Z||000000||Gokart||07-23-2000||07:19 AM||||Anyone here ever try it? Notice any improvement in performance? I figure it couldn't hurt because of the amount of carbon I've seen in the manifolds when I had the plenum off and imagine there must be quite a bit in the cylinders with 120,000 on my engine. <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html</A>  <P>------------------<BR> Marc                     87GT||||reg||5
