Z||000010||Gokart||07-29-2000||10:27 PM||||Got e-mail from Carolles yesterday answering my application questions and he didn't mention any special tools?! gtsonly saw my topic and offered to do our own test with Ed's "special mix"! He has the equipment to do a "before and after" look into the engine so we'll post results when we're done <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Gokart_sig_1.gif"> <P>Marc                     87GT||||reg||14
